meta {
  name: Register
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

post {
  url: {{host}}/api/v1/petrovis
  body: multipartForm
  auth: inherit
}

body:multipart-form {
  spe_id: c58a8a69-56a9-4c35-8a5f-9e95eae8b7ee
  email: example@email.com
  total_delegates: 2
  payment_method: QRIS
  voucher_code: PETROVIS2026
  delegates[0][name]: John Doe
  delegates[0][student_id]: 12345678
  delegates[0][phone_number]: 628123456789
  delegates[0][faculty]: Engineering
  delegates[0][major]: Petroleum Engineering
  delegates[0][batch]: 2023
  delegates[0][gender]: Male
  delegates[0][institution]: Universitas Indonesia
  delegates[0][department]: Faculty of Engineering
  delegates[0][motivation]: Want to learn more
  delegates[0][participated_before]: false
  delegates[0][heard_from]: Instagram
  delegates[0][scan_id]: @file(/path/to/scan/id.pdf)
  delegates[1][name]: Jane Doe
  delegates[1][student_id]: 87654321
  delegates[1][phone_number]: 628987654321
  delegates[1][faculty]: Engineering
  delegates[1][major]: Petroleum Engineering
  delegates[1][batch]: 2023
  delegates[1][gender]: Female
  delegates[1][institution]: Universitas Indonesia
  delegates[1][department]: Faculty of Engineering
  delegates[1][motivation]: Join my friend
  delegates[1][participated_before]: true
  delegates[1][heard_from]: Friends
  delegates[1][scan_id]: @file(/path/to/scan/id2.pdf)
}

vars:post-response {
  petrovis_id: res.body.data.id
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  ## Description
  Public endpoint for registering Petrovis (SPE) event delegates with 1-3 delegates per registration. Creates a Tripay payment transaction and returns the payment URL for completion. Supports optional voucher codes for discounted internal pricing.

  ## Authentication
  - None (public endpoint)

  ## Request Parameters (multipart/form-data)
  | Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
  |-----------|------|----------|-------------|
  | spe_id | string(uuid) | No | UUID of the SPE (Student Petroleum Engineering) organization |
  | email | string(email) | Yes | Contact email for the registration |
  | total_delegates | integer | Yes | Total number of delegates (1-3) |
  | payment_method | string | Yes | **Must be "QRIS" only** - other payment methods are rejected |
  | voucher_code | string | No | Optional voucher code for discounted pricing (for example `PETROVIS2026`) |
  | delegates[] | array | Yes | Array of delegate objects (max 3) |

  ### Delegate Fields
  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  |-------|------|----------|-------------|
  | delegates[x][name] | string | Yes | Full name of the delegate |
  | delegates[x][student_id] | string | Yes | Student ID number |
  | delegates[x][phone_number] | string | Yes | Phone number (format: 62...) |
  | delegates[x][faculty] | string | Yes | Faculty name |
  | delegates[x][major] | string | Yes | Major/Study program |
  | delegates[x][batch] | string | Yes | Batch/year of study |
  | delegates[x][gender] | string | Yes | Gender (Male/Female) |
  | delegates[x][institution] | string | Yes | Institution/Organization name |
  | delegates[x][department] | string | Yes | Department name |
  | delegates[x][motivation] | string | Yes | Motivation for joining |
  | delegates[x][participated_before] | boolean | Yes | Have participated before? |
  | delegates[x][heard_from] | string | Yes | Where did you hear about this? |
  | delegates[x][scan_id] | file | Yes | ID card scan image (JPG/PNG/PDF) |

  ## Pricing
  | Type | Price per Delegate |
  |------|-------------------|
  | Public (no voucher code) | Rp 250,000 |
  | Internal (with valid voucher code) | Rp 180,000 |

  **Example**: 2 delegates with voucher code = 180,000 x 2 = Rp 360,000

  ## Voucher Code Behavior
  - If provided and valid: Applies discounted pricing
  - If invalid/expired/exhausted: Returns error with details
  - If omitted: Uses standard public pricing
  - Code usage is incremented atomically to prevent race conditions

  ## Response Structure
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "success to register Petrovis",
    "data": {
      "invoice_url": "https://payment.tripay.co/..."
    }
  }
  ```

  ## Error Responses

  ### Invalid Payment Method (400)
  ```json
  {
    "success": false,
    "message": "failed to register Petrovis",
    "error": "only QRIS payment method is allowed for Petrovis registration"
  }
  ```

  ### Invalid Voucher Code (404)
  ```json
  {
    "success": false,
    "message": "failed to register Petrovis",
    "error": "failed to get voucher code"
  }
  ```

  ### Exhausted Voucher Code (400)
  ```json
  {
    "success": false,
    "message": "failed to register Petrovis",
    "error": "voucher code usage limit reached"
  }
  ```

  ### Inactive Voucher Code (400)
  ```json
  {
    "success": false,
    "message": "failed to register Petrovis",
    "error": "voucher code is not active"
  }
  ```

  ### Duplicate Data (409)
  ```json
  {
    "success": false,
    "message": "failed to register Petrovis",
    "error": "email is already registered for Petrovis"
  }
  ```

  ### Other Errors
  | Status | Message |
  |--------|---------|
  | 400 | Invalid request body (validation errors on fields) |
  | 400 | total_delegates does not match with the number of delegates |
  | 400 | voucher code is not valid for Petrovis |
  | 404 | SPE not found (if spe_id provided) |
  | 500 | Failed to register Petrovis |

  ## Business Logic Notes
  - **Payment Method Restriction**: Only QRIS payment method is allowed
  - **Pricing**:
    - Public price: Rp 250,000 per delegate
    - Internal price: Rp 180,000 per delegate (with valid voucher code)
  - **Voucher Code Validation**:
    - Code must be active and within date range
    - Code must match the Petrovis voucher pricing setup
    - Usage count must be below usage limit
    - Usage is incremented atomically within the transaction
  - First delegate in the array is automatically marked as **LEADER** type
  - Subsequent delegates are marked as **MEMBER** type
  - All scan_id files are uploaded concurrently to AWS S3 path: `event/petrovis/`
  - Tripay transaction is created with order ID format: `EVENT-{uuid}`
  - Payment invoice expires after 24 hours (86400 seconds)
  - Welcome email is sent to the leader (first delegate's email or registration email)
  - SPE must exist and be validated if spe_id is provided
  - total_delegates must match the actual number of delegate objects provided
  - **Transaction Safety**: Full rollback on any validation error (voucher code, payment, file upload)

  ## Example Request without Voucher Code (Public Price)
  ```
  POST /api/v1/petrovis
  Content-Type: multipart/form-data

  spe_id: c58a8a69-56a9-4c35-8a5f-9e95eae8b7ee
  email: user@example.com
  total_delegates: 1
  payment_method: QRIS
  delegates[0][name]: John Doe
  delegates[0][student_id]: 12345678
  ... (other delegate fields)

  Result: Price = Rp 250,000 (public price)
  ```

  ## Example Request with Voucher Code (Internal Price)
  ```
  POST /api/v1/petrovis
  Content-Type: multipart/form-data

  spe_id: c58a8a69-56a9-4c35-8a5f-9e95eae8b7ee
  email: user@example.com
  total_delegates: 2
  payment_method: QRIS
  voucher_code: PETROVIS2026
  delegates[0][name]: John Doe
  delegates[0][student_id]: 12345678
  ... (other delegate fields)
  delegates[1][name]: Jane Doe
  delegates[1][student_id]: 87654321
  ... (other delegate fields)

  Result: Price = Rp 180,000 x 2 = Rp 360,000 (internal price)
  ```
}
